<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Sept 20.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Sept 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Oct/Dec 129.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Sep 129.00</p>
<p>London Oct 125.25 Apr/Jun 132.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Suffolk/Essex Oct/Dec 110.00/10.50</p>
<p>Avon Oct/Dec 110.00 Southampton Oct 108.50</p>
<p>South Wales Sep 106.50 Oct 108.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Avon range Oct 105.00 Oct/Dec 106.00</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex Oct/Dec 107.00</p>
</text>
